@jiayus-nvidia Fixed in 37979aaf. The H96/D576 stride-specialization expectation now uses h96_d576_2cta_m64, while retaining static_stride=True and the existing stride assertions.

I reproduced the failure on an actual SM90 device and reran the full DSA backward L0 file after the fix: 121 passed, 125 skipped.
Could you please rerun python/*/cutedsl on the updated SHA?

